  m_Text: "\u2753Answer questions: When passing through the coin, you will have to
    answer a multiple choice question.\n\u2192 Answer correctly to receive a coin.\n\u2192
    Answer incorrectly to lose a star.\n\nEach level has 3 stars. If you lose all
    the stars \u2192 Lose.\n\u2705Complete the level when you collect all the coins."
